                         << "  🚨 esta raíz no da para todo: " << n_unreached
                         << " isla(s) no alcanzan ningún tocón con " << zone_stumps[zi].size()
                         << " plantado(s) — planta otro tocón bajo esa zona, o sube el ángulo");
+                // [ORCAPORT:SU-16] BEGIN - what does not fit the stumps goes down the general flow
+                // Measured on the release note's surfboard: fixing only the islands that reached no
+                // stump still left the support hanging ~2.6 mm off the bed, because the guided run
